{"version":1,"key":"card:689","content":{"id":689,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"efa9f7ad-2fcd-4a47-b1df-64ddbca216f6","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"moveBefore(nodeToMove, referenceNode)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 函数的作用是把 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"nodeToMove"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 插入到 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"referenceNode"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 之前，"},{"type":"formatted","textGradient":"ocean","text":"同时保留该节点及其子节点的所有内部状态。"}]},{"type":"highlight-block","disableDrag":false,"color":"red","tauContract":"8d7373dfc1d83f7abd6f07067a85198c9127dba4aebf48d6d59b33956048da37","collabId":"96ce138b-4271-472e-a70c-3ede7ee8f9e5","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"122fe6a9-b5a6-4208-9b0b-a8edc2a50c77","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"referenceNode"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以设置为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"null"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，当设置为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"null"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时，则表示插入到目标父元素的最后。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"724e982a-9b8d-4060-825e-1899ef07c826","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在此之前我们想移动节点，通常会通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"appendChild"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或者 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"insertBefore"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 等 DOM API 实现，但是这种插入并不是「原子」的，而是分为了两个过程，第一步先把节点从 DOM 树中移除，第二步把节点插入到相应位置，这就会导致如下问题："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"55f7160e-8c4a-468b-92fd-1bc9c80bd953","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"8cba058e-2236-425d-8f46-de1beabeea0e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"579b95ff-d050-45cb-af37-82b5b1e9014d","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"iframe"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 会重新加载"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"554a933e-c673-4a80-9af0-efca25bdff68","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"053d61a8-31c1-48de-9133-43a501b74168","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"正在进行的动画会中断"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"126f97c0-dd94-4cc8-a496-ecd8cc0e836a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"754e11da-a0b2-4f2b-9b63-01f3be314e0a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"焦点会丢失，用户选中的文本也会丢失"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"0b58ca84-6d7c-4c31-8ace-84dd30faf010","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"094ed488-bf39-4194-8e6c-351bcbb5168a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Web Components 会触发 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"disconnectedCallback"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"connectedCallback"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，这可能会导致组件内部执行不必要的清理和重新初始化逻辑"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"b8d080f5-540d-4d3c-b2a0-0d4549735457","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4ddea84c-e04c-4583-b560-7f4af7c9ebc7","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"popover"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dialog"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 会被关闭，其内部的焦点也会丢失，需要通过代码重新显示出来"}]}]}]},{"type":"highlight-block","color":"red","tauContract":"8d7373dfc1d83f7abd6f07067a85198c9127dba4aebf48d6d59b33956048da37","collabId":"440300a5-bd04-4d80-9af9-1b81a83e250b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bf9eb261-eff8-405e-89b0-386edec41bf1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"媒体资源（音视频）无论使用何种方式移动，它的状态都会被保留，这是浏览器内部做的优化。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9755d5ec-c382-4593-943e-e944aba3f8fa","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"而 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"moveBefore"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 它是一种"},{"type":"formatted","textGradient":"ocean","text":"「原子移动」"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，在移动的过程中可以保留所有的状态，这意味着以上情况都不会发生："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"77238b57-d99d-4994-9fba-526ca20f4cb2","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"ba9efd7c-a8f7-44b7-8692-3d044c6c400f","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7105fbca-04a9-4d38-8a74-47f0b7f181fc","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"iframe"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 不会重新加载"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"9de7eaba-b586-4c08-b3aa-759e4753711a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bd0c5652-c84a-4d8b-997b-9b483f832be5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"动画会继续执行"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"65b827d0-a631-4c47-a681-074bbdcab859","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"09b839d6-23fb-422a-9f42-5c262cb4dd25","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"焦点会继续保持在移动的元素中，选中的文字样式也会保留"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"a51f8d7f-b66e-4feb-8dfa-e687199444c2","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1777e650-dada-4f7c-98d4-0a2d4ec8ba93","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Web Components 会触发一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"connectedMoveCallback"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的生命周期函数，不会触发 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"disconnectedCallback"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"connectedCallback"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"28b8cbe1-9f69-473d-b520-1aa92508f092","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e2a1ce8e-482b-4f76-abb7-dd9640731de6","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"popover"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dialog"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 等元素的状态保持，不会因为移动而导致被意外关闭"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6aca6e14-5474-4cfc-b916-474232bc085a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"比较典型的使用场景是 React/Vue 框架中的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"createPortal"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Teleport"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，为了防止被 CSS 的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"overflow: hidden"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 裁剪，通常会把元素插入到 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"body"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 下，通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"insertBefore"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或者 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"appendChild"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 等 API 就会导致之前状态丢失，有了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"moveBefore"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 状态就可以得以保存。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5125d478-723a-4e5e-8f8f-177c5369e6e5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"还有拖拽排序、动态调整布局、模态框/抽屉组件的位置调整等场景，只要涉及到需要保持元素状态的 DOM 移动，都可以用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"moveBefore"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"34b8be0c-5c26-4bb1-b6ea-f633731e9644","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"下面是一些具体的代码示例："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JAVASCRIPT","uuid":"3c7e3204-9445-41a1-8cb6-4ec40272ff89","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"1ed00ffb-2597-42e3-a4da-b7ecfc7906ab","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"// 基本用法示例\nconst container = document.querySelector('#container');\nconst item = document.querySelector('#item');\nconst reference = document.querySelector('#reference');\n\n// 移动到 reference 之前\ncontainer.moveBefore(item, reference);\n\n// 移动到容器最后（reference 为 null）\ncontainer.moveBefore(item, null);","collabId":"10023999-e79c-4064-a399-ccf18a8599ae","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JAVASCRIPT","uuid":"33ae7b23-4b5e-4c49-bf7c-fa4c15d2eacc","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"6dc6dda7-f19d-4269-8d07-3fcb4e59f523","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"// 拖拽排序场景\nfunction handleDragDrop(draggedElement, dropTarget) {\n  const parent = dropTarget.parentElement;\n  // 使用 moveBefore 保持拖拽元素的所有状态\n  // 比如正在播放的视频、输入框的焦点等\n  parent.moveBefore(draggedElement, dropTarget);\n}","collabId":"bd1cb9fb-8027-47e7-80bf-19610896adc6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JAVASCRIPT","uuid":"7747bcd7-ca17-4fef-af2f-9bc7cc72bc8d","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"36a2ed88-350a-43bc-855e-40e3b8dd4bcb","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"// 对比传统方式的问题\nconst iframe = document.querySelector('iframe');\nconst newParent = document.querySelector('#new-parent');\n\n// ❌ 传统方式：iframe 会重新加载，用户填写的表单数据丢失\nnewParent.appendChild(iframe);\n\n// ✅ 使用 moveBefore：iframe 不会重新加载，状态完整保留\nnewParent.moveBefore(iframe, null);","collabId":"25ab2772-c260-4e14-9c5b-956446fe8377","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JAVASCRIPT","uuid":"dbaf9bd7-5c57-481d-b0d4-5a3c0fa116e6","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"6381db4b-497c-4236-a1db-d3030596fbe4","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"// Web Components 中的 connectedMoveCallback\nclass MyElement extends HTMLElement {\n  connectedMoveCallback() {\n    // 元素被 moveBefore 移动时触发\n    // 可以在这里做一些轻量级的更新，而不需要重新初始化\n    console.log('元素被移动了，但状态保留');\n  }\n  \n  connectedCallback() {\n    // 使用 insertBefore/appendChild 时会触发\n    console.log('元素被插入，需要重新初始化');\n  }\n  \n  disconnectedCallback() {\n    // 使用 insertBefore/appendChild 时会先触发\n    console.log('元素被移除，需要清理资源');\n  }\n}","collabId":"6dd28eff-3af8-4fc7-aea6-bbe8a119f772","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"highlight-block","color":"yellow","tauContract":"8d7373dfc1d83f7abd6f07067a85198c9127dba4aebf48d6d59b33956048da37","collabId":"e8b35b1f-1229-480f-9680-b80b1f2a1341","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0c040261-b245-478a-b7f9-1326e134018f","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"moveBefore"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的使用限制和注意事项："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"e507770c-ffa9-4630-88f9-fd7ce08df360","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"05e83fe5-5097-4347-af3b-4818e5b12862","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5112d079-e59d-4878-93c2-af8d58e9ecbe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"移动的元素必须在页面中，即必须是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"isConnected"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的，否则会报错，而 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"insertBefore"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 不要求必须在页面中，在内存中就可以，比如通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"createElement"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 创建的元素"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"79bcd0d9-122f-4747-9fb9-0ceb72f55378","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a14e99ac-5c19-4bf4-9d05-10f146087634","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"referenceNode"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 必须是目标父节点的直接子节点，否则会抛出 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"NotFoundError"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JAVASCRIPT","uuid":"d67543fb-76a3-479c-983c-fa645bcf49d2","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"1c597e99-7825-42a3-a8a9-9b6f2698140f","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"slotB.moveBefore(node, referenceNode)\n//  ↑ 目标父节点         ↑ 必须是 slotB 的直接子节点","collabId":"f671b15b-a391-46a3-b5bc-eef313d002c7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"62641625-bfc9-4877-bfbd-64ea0165e116","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a17fdd0f-b6f7-4046-89fa-1912428606ac","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不能跨文档移动，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"nodeToMove"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和目标父节点必须在同一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"document"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中，否则会抛出 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"HierarchyRequestError"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。如果需要跨文档移动，还是得用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"adoptNode"},{"type":"formatted","text":" + "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"insertBefore"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的组合"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JAVASCRIPT","uuid":"927bfc7f-c156-4769-9587-1f04fc0bb5ac","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"6fd56ed2-14a6-4f67-9a89-b1b8fc5d7433","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"// 跨文档移动的场景（比如从 iframe 中移动元素到主文档）\nconst iframe = document.querySelector('iframe');\nconst iframeDoc = iframe.contentDocument;\nconst nodeFromIframe = iframeDoc.querySelector('#some-element');\nconst mainDocContainer = document.querySelector('#container');\n\n// ❌ 错误：不能直接跨文档使用 moveBefore\n// mainDocContainer.moveBefore(nodeFromIframe, null); // 抛出 HierarchyRequestError\n\n// ✅ 正确：先用 adoptNode 把节点\"过继\"到目标文档，再插入\nconst adoptedNode = document.adoptNode(nodeFromIframe);\nmainDocContainer.insertBefore(adoptedNode, null);\n// 注意：这种方式会丢失状态，因为 adoptNode 本身就会断开连接","collabId":"11e5b368-d799-4e30-9ca2-bbec33a57120","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"5589fa24-c03c-479f-a6e2-3a28dde2825f","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c9c009d3-8959-46ab-93cc-6c440d67171c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不能移动到自己的子孙节点下，否则会抛出 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"HierarchyRequestError"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，这和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"insertBefore"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的行为一致"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JAVASCRIPT","uuid":"c5239dae-81fc-40e7-8e6f-794671b13d07","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"fc4a9a1b-2385-4419-8ee8-24b54289fd56","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"// ❌ 错误：不能把父元素移动到自己的子元素下\nconst parent = document.querySelector('#parent');\nconst child = document.querySelector('#child'); // child 是 parent 的子元素\nchild.moveBefore(parent, null); // 抛出 HierarchyRequestError","collabId":"2b6754bd-cc4b-4e1e-964e-b015aa457790","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"0f31f437-fbb2-447c-98ae-c2ccd4118d13","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"afc5d8b1-8cf9-4869-99b8-b33272ef07f0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"nodeToMove"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"referenceNode"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是同一个节点，什么都不会发生，不会报错"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"3d7b31ab-22f3-48fd-8623-60ef274a44be","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0d55eb11-8fb4-4098-9f07-3864b31dadac","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"虽然 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"moveBefore"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 保留了大部分状态，但某些 CSS 相关的状态可能会受影响："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"85a9bbd5-c213-4277-8d66-cb76c38bed56","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"a30a9c7b-3836-4ab7-8ee6-5ad212907530","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"850c064b-c2dd-4a3a-b9f5-7ecd3ebaa6da","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"CSS 过渡（"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"transition"},{"type":"formatted","text":"）可能会被打断或重新触发，取决于移动前后的样式变化"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"5151fcc0-7b6f-498d-94c6-e5ec29804811","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"09f78c6c-7ca3-4245-b08b-0b4f1cab5771","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"某些依赖于 DOM 位置的 CSS 选择器（如 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":":first-child"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"for